    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Secrets\" title=\"Force Secrets\">Force Secrets</a></i> </p><p>You can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to link a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a> to the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a> you use in the current round so that it goes off in the following round. You must choose two <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Powers\" title=\"Force Powers\">Force Powers</a>- one for the current and one for the next round. Both selected <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Powers\" title=\"Force Powers\">Force Powers</a> cannot be altered in any way, such as through <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Techniques\" title=\"Force Techniques\">Force Techniques</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Secrets\" title=\"Force Secrets\">Force Secrets</a>, or the use of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Points\" title=\"Force Points\">Force Points</a>. However, the second <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a> goes off in the following round as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Free_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Free Action\">Free Action</a> at the start of your turn. </p>",
